---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Yann Borgnet | IFMGA mountain guide"}
  description={"Yann Borgnet, IFMGA mountain guide, professor at ENSA and doctor of geography. Raids, ski crossings, journeying and mountains."}
  canonical={canonical}
>
  <Header solid />

  <main>
    <section class="ed-hero">
      <div class="ed-hero__media">
        <PhotoSlot fill tone="dark" file="DSC05274-1024x683.jpg" />
      </div>
      <div class="site-shell ed-hero__inner">
        <p class="ed-hero__eyebrow">{"Who am I?"}</p>
        <h1>
          <span>{"Yann Borgnet."}</span>
          <span class="ed-hero__sub">{"Guide, teacher, geographer."}</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ed-hero__lead">
          {"IFMGA mountain guide, associate professor of PE, professor at ENSA and doctor of geography. A practice of the profession focused on journeying, exploration and long-distance ski trips."}
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ed-section ed-section--white" id="parcours">
      <div class="site-shell ed-split">
        <div class="ed-split__head">
          <p class="ed-eyebrow">{"Course"}</p>
          <h2 class="ed-h2">{"The mountain as a terrain for travel and research."}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-prose">
          <p>
            {"Originally from Annecy, I was a normalien at the ENS in Rennes before becoming an associate professor of PE. Today I am IFMGA mountain guide and a professor at the National Ski and Mountaineering School (ENSA) in Chamonix since 2022. In May 2024, I defended a doctoral thesis in geography devoted to the transformations of alpine tourism and the adaptation of mountain practices and territories."}
          </p>
          <p>
            {"In 2015, a crossing of the Alps from Corsica to Slovenia, carried out without motorised means and by mixing several alpine practices, profoundly influenced the way I view the profession of guide. Since then, the journeying has become the guiding light of my practice."}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ed-section ed-section--dark" id="metier">
      <div class="site-shell">
        <div class="ed-split">
          <div class="ed-split__head">
            <p class="ed-eyebrow">{"The profession"}</p>
            <h2 class="ed-h2">{"Draw lines rather than collect vertices."}</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="ed-prose">
            <p>
              {"Today I devote a large part of my winters to raids and ski crossings, in the Alps and in the mountains of the world. The journeys are built around a line: connecting valleys, villages, huts or bivouacs, and understanding a territory by crossing it."}
            </p>
            <p>
              {"Preparation involves maps, aerial images, discussions with local residents and professionals. On the ground, the route remains alive: it adapts to the snow, the weather, the group and what the mountain allows."}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-photo">
          <PhotoSlot ratio="21 / 9" tone="dark" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ed-section ed-section--paper" id="recherche">
      <div class="site-shell ed-split ed-split--even">
        <div>
          <p class="ed-eyebrow">{"Search &amp; transmission"}</p>
          <h2 class="ed-h2">{"Thinking about the transformations of the mountain."}</h2>
          <div class="ed-prose" style="margin-top: 32px">
            <p>
              {"My research work focuses on developments in alpine tourism, the effects of climate change and the restructuring of mountain practices and territories. This reflection also nourishes my way of teaching and guiding."}
            </p>
            <p>
              {"At ENSA, I am involved in the training of mountain professionals. I also write about the profession of guide, risk management and the transformations of mountain tourism."}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="ed-eyebrow">{"Landmarks"}</p>
          <ul class="yann-reperes">
            {
              reperes.map((r) => (
                <li>
                  <h3>{r.title}</h3>
                  <p>{r.text}</p>
                  {r.href && (
                    <a
                      class="ed-link"
                      href={r.external ? r.href : localizedHref(lang, r.href)}
                      target={r.external ? "_blank" : undefined}
                      rel={r.external ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
                    >
                      {r.linkLabel}
                      {r.external && <span class="ed-sr"> {"(new tab)"}</span>}
                    </a>
                  )}
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ed-section ed-section--dark" id="publications">
      <div class="site-shell">
        <div class="yann-pubs__intro">
          <p class="ed-eyebrow">{"Search &amp; publications"}</p>
          <h2 class="ed-h2">{"Write and document the transformations of mountain tourism."}</h2>
        </div>

        <ul class="yann-pubs__list">
          {
            publications.map((p) => (
              <li class="yann-pub">
                <p class="yann-pub__meta">
                  <span>{p.year}</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true"> — </span>
                  <span>{p.source}</span>
                </p>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="yann-pub__title">{p.title}</h3>
                  {p.authors && <p class="yann-pub__authors">{p.authors}</p>}
                  <a class="ed-link" href={p.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    {p.cta}
                    <span class="ed-sr"> {"(new tab)"}</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>

        <article class="yann-featured">
          <p class="yann-featured__label">{thesis.label}</p>
          <h3 class="yann-featured__title">{thesis.title}</h3>
          <p class="yann-featured__meta">{thesis.meta}</p>
          <p class="yann-featured__links">
            <a class="ed-link" href={thesis.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {thesis.cta}<span class="ed-sr"> {"(new tab)"}</span>
            </a>
            <a class="ed-link" href={thesis.fullTextHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {thesis.fullTextCta}<span class="ed-sr"> {"(new tab)"}</span>
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>

        {
          groups.map((group) => (
            <div class="yann-group" id={`publications-${group.id}`}>
              <h3 class="yann-group__title">{group.heading}</h3>
              <ul class="yann-pubs__list yann-pubs__list--cols">
                {group.entries.map((entry) => (
                  <li class="yann-card">
                    <p class="yann-pub__meta">
                      <span>{entry.year}</span>
                      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
                      <span>{entry.source}</span>
                    </p>
                    <h4 class="yann-card__title">{entry.title}</h4>
                    {entry.note && <p class="yann-card__note">{entry.note}</p>}
                    <a class="ed-link" href={entry.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                      {entry.cta}
                      <span class="ed-sr"> {"(new tab)"}</span>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))
        }

        <div class="ed-cta">
          <a href={localizedHref(lang, "/prochains-voyages/")}>{"Discover travel →"}</a>
          <a href={localizedHref(lang, "/carnets-de-voyage-ski/")}>{"Read the notebooks →"}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <ContactStrip />

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="site-shell site-footer__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">LES GRANDS RAIDS À SKI</p>
        <p class="site-footer__statement">{"Explore · improvise · meet · ski."}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="site-footer__links">
        <a href="https://wa.me/33689295826">{"WhatsApp · +33 6 89 29 58 26"}</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/lesgrandsraidsaski/">{"Instagram"}</a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/yannborgnet/">{"Facebook"}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SponsorStrip />

    <div class="site-shell site-footer__bottom">
      <span>{"Yann Borgnet · IFMGA mountain guide"}</span>
      <span>© 2026</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
